{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14792","headline":"虢州逢侯钊同寻南观因赠别 · 卢纶","name":"虢州逢侯钊同寻南观因赠别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相见翻惆怅，应怜责废官。\n过深慙禄在，识浅赖刑宽。\n独失耕农业，同思弟侄欢。\n衰贫羞客过，卑束会君难。\n放鹤登云壁，浇花遶石坛。\n兴远江海上，迹在是非端。\n林密风声细，山高雨色寒。\n悠然此中别，宾仆亦阑干。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14792.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14792","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}